# Benchmark run state is never committed: working folders and sealed holdouts (above),
# dataset copies, agent checkpoints, submitted models, response caches and lock files.
# Only the scored results (results/<suite>/<system>.jsonl), reports and charts are kept.
results/**/*.parquet
results/**/*.sqlite
results/**/*.sqlite-*
results/**/*.pkl
results/**/*.lock
results/**/cache/
**/checkpoints.sqlite*
.holdout/